      "uid": "zhcn:688117f4c1e73306dca4b21a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "以空中神宫收集的数据为基础，\n“Parcae”会计算出最佳解。\n她对这位“伙伴”深信不疑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab40840ebc9caa2a7f7ae26405c802fa3f0968ace4228e52ba6c3020c650ea05",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
